Third-party components (each under its own license, unmodified):

- Swift packages (App, HerdrSSH): Citadel, SwiftNIO, swift-nio-ssh,
  swift-crypto, swift-asn1, swift-atomics, swift-collections, swift-log,
  swift-system (Apache-2.0); BigInt (MIT).
- Rust crates linked into the app (TetheraLinkFFI) and the `tethera`
  connector: iroh and its dependencies, mostly MIT OR Apache-2.0; ICU4X
  crates (Unicode-3.0); webpki-roots (CDLA-Permissive-2.0); uniffi
  runtime and attohttpc (MPL-2.0, used unmodified; source at
  https://github.com/mozilla/uniffi-rs and
  https://github.com/sbstp/attohttpc). The full list with versions is
  link/Cargo.lock (`cargo metadata` prints each crate's license).

An in-app acknowledgements screen with the full license texts is still to
be added before release.

